WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.300
Alright,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.367
a number series!

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:11.067
Four,

00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:11.767
eight,

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:12.467
sixteen,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:13.133
thirty-two,

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.533
and then...

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:16.600
what comes next?

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.300
A.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.000
Sixty-seven,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.700
B.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.400
Sixty-nine,

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.067
C.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:20.767
Sixty-four,

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:22.167
or D.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:22.867
Sixty-five?

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:24.233
Five seconds!

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:31.233
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:32.433
It's...

00:00:32.433 --> 00:00:32.967
C,

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.500
sixty-four!

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.667
Each number is multiplied by two,

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:39.867
so the next one is thirty-two

00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:41.967
times two is sixty-four.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:43.800
Alright!

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.067
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:47.700
A.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:48.367
Sleet,

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:49.033
B.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:49.667
Snow,

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:50.333
C.

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:50.967
Wrist,

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:52.300
or D.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:52.933
Thunder?

00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:54.267
Five seconds!

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:01.233
TIME'S UP!

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:02.367
It's...

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:02.800
C,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.267
wrist!

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:03.733
Sleet,

00:01:03.733 --> 00:01:04.167
thunder,

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:06.900
and snow are all kinds of

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.367
weather.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.633
Wrist is a body part,

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:11.900
so it does not belong.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:14.200
Here's one,

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.900
a number puzzle,

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.600
and it's sneaky!

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:21.000
If eight plus three makes thirteen,

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.833
five plus two makes three,

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.633
three plus five makes seven,

00:01:26.633 --> 00:01:29.467
then seven plus eight makes...

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:30.033
what?

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:30.600
A.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:31.167
Forty-one,

00:01:31.167 --> 00:01:31.733
B.

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:32.300
Forty-two,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:32.867
C.

00:01:32.867 --> 00:01:33.433
Fifteen,

00:01:33.433 --> 00:01:34.567
or D.

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:35.133
Thirty-six?

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:36.267
Five seconds!

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.267
TIME'S UP!

00:01:43.933 --> 00:01:45.300
The answer is...

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:45.767
A,

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.233
forty-one!

00:01:46.233 --> 00:01:49.000
The trick is to multiply them,

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.300
then take away their sum:

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.600
fifty-six minus fifteen is forty-one.

00:01:54.767 --> 00:01:55.167
So,

00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:57.200
are you smart or fart?

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.633
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:59.633 --> 00:02:00.833
find your rank!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:02.333
So,

00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:03.733
how did you do?

00:02:03.733 --> 00:02:05.100
Comment your score below,

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.467
and follow for more!
